      "panel-1": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 1,
          "title": "About reducer macros",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "group": "grafana-testdata-datasource",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "PD8C576611E62080A"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "scenarioId": "raw_frame",
                        "rawFrameContent": "[{\"schema\":{\"fields\":[{\"name\":\"Time\",\"type\":\"time\"},{\"name\":\"CPU\",\"type\":\"number\"},{\"name\":\"Memory usage\",\"type\":\"number\"}]},\"data\":{\"values\":[[1793008800000,1793008860000,1793008920000],[40,75,null],[100,null,120]]}}]"
                      }
                    },
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "13.3.0-local",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                },
                "content": "## Reducer macros\n\n`${__data.fields.<field>:reduce:<reducer>}` reduces one field across every row, so it resolves in **Once** mode, where there is no row.\n\nEach field is reduced on its own. With the data below, the last non-null CPU value and the last non-null memory value come from **different rows**.\n\n| Time | CPU | Memory usage |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| +0 min | 40 | 100 |\n| +1 min | 75 | null |\n| +2 min | null | 120 |\n\nCPU uses unit `percent` with 1 decimal. Memory usage uses unit `bytes`. Both come from field overrides.\n\nEvery other panel lists the macro, what it renders, and what it should render. If **Result** and **Expected** differ, something is broken.\n\nIn edit mode, type `$` in Once mode: field suggestions insert `:reduce:lastNotNull`. Type after `:reduce:` to pick another reducer.\n",
                "mode": "markdown",
                "renderMode": "once"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": [
                  {
                    "matcher": {
                      "id": "byName",
                      "options": "CPU"
                    },
                    "properties": [
                      {
                        "id": "unit",
                        "value": "percent"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "decimals",
                        "value": 1
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "matcher": {
                      "id": "byName",
                      "options": "Memory usage"
                    },
                    "properties": [
                      {
                        "id": "unit",
                        "value": "bytes"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
